{
  "name": "canvas-lab",
  "version": "0.1.31",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "公司图像模型的本地运营与测试工作台",
  "releaseNotes": [
    "生图工作台顶栏显示当前 OneAPI Key 的剩余额度，点击金额可打开连接中心，点击刷新图标可重新查询。",
    "「Beta跑图」更名为「批量跑图」，新增平面图机位渲染和多角度批量出图。各页面的刷新图标统一为圆角单箭头。",
    "平面图机位渲染支持取景裁剪、送模预览、提示词直出与空间推理，主工作台可选择 Qwen Image Edit 2511。",
    "新增「添加人物/宠物」入口，可在场景图中合成人物或宠物，并从 AI 渲染台带入渲染结果。",
    "生图模型目录新增 Banana Pro 和 Seedream 5.5，可用性取决于当前 OneAPI Key 权限。",
    "全景图美化更新 FastFlux2 工作流和光影预设，支持按多个光影模板独立出图对比。"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "benchmark": "node --env-file-if-exists=.env.local benchmark-runner.mjs",
    "benchmark:backfill": "node --env-file-if-exists=.env.local benchmark-backfill.mjs",
    "lark:init": "lark-cli config init --new",
    "lark:status": "lark-cli auth status --json --verify",
    "release:check": "node scripts/release-check.mjs",
    "release:pack": "node scripts/release-pack.mjs",
    "release:publish": "node scripts/release-publish.mjs",
    "start": "node --env-file-if-exists=.env.local server.mjs",
    "test": "node --test"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@fontsource-variable/inter": "5.3.0",
    "@larksuite/cli": "1.0.77",
    "pannellum": "2.5.7",
    "sharp": "0.35.5",
    "undici": "7.30.1"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24"
  },
  "allowScripts": {
    "@larksuite/cli@1.0.77": true
  }
}
